  "body": "- Handle a case where an element with autofocus is connected and then disconnected before focused.<br>https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/11193\r\n- [First step of the algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/form-control-infrastructure.html#autofocusing-a-form-control:-the-autofocus-attribute) is too vague<br>https://github.com/web-platform-tests/wpt/pull/16780#issuecomment-491640726\r\n- Also, see [Autofocus spec should probably allow browsers to delay running the focusing steps, maybe? ](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/3551)\r\n\r\n",
